*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dogenstein]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
